==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the male form of {{p|Oinkologne}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Oinkologne|183}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
*'''Leg Stomp''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Oinkologne|157}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

